// Builds the tools_functions deck ZIP from images generated by Cardgen Studio.
// Reads images from: c:/Users/dmazn/Projects/Mirocard/cardgen-studio/projects/tools_functions/generated/
// Run after Cardgen Studio finishes rendering and approving all 60 cards.
